            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "From @bfredl \n\n> _All_ symbols which are non-`static` should be exposed out of the binary as delicious PIE. This is the behavior on GNOOO/LINUX and the task at hand is to find whatever arcane build system incantations which are necessary to match this simple sanity on windows, darwin and other supported platforms.\n\nI [looked into it](https://ziglang.org/learn/build-system/) but didn't find anything useful.  Would it be worth opening an issue on Zig itself?",
