            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "@bfredl in the meantime, I found that\n\n```diff\ndiff --git a/build.zig b/build.zig\nindex 8421dfbc85..ed3d38eb7b 100644\n--- a/build.zig\n+++ b/build.zig\n@@ -495,6 +495,7 @@ pub fn build(b: *std.Build) !void {\n         .root_module = nvim_mod,\n     }) else b.addExecutable(.{ .name = \"nvim\", .root_module = nvim_mod });\n     nvim_exe.rdynamic = true; // -E\n+    nvim_exe.link_gc_sections = false;\n     if (emscripten_libc_path) |lp| nvim_exe.setLibCFile(lp);\n     if (is_wasm) nvim_exe.entry = .disabled;\n     if (is_wasm) nvim_exe.linker_allow_shlib_undefined = true;\n```\n\nalso fixes the issue.  It increases the size of the macOS binary from 7.3M to 7.5M.  Would you approve a PR with this change?  Optionally I can wrap it in a `if (is_mac)` check with a comment linking to this issue.",
